<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Record Not Found</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol";
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #343a40;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 40px;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5em;
      color: #dc3545; /* A gentle red for error messages */
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.1em;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    a {
      color: #007bff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    a:hover {
      color: #0056b3;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Oops! Record Not Found</h1>
    <p>We're sorry, but the page or record you were looking for doesn't exist.</p>
    <p>It may have been moved or deleted. Please double-check the URL, or let us help you find your way back.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="/">Return to the Homepage</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>